## 🎯 3. Project Objectives

| # | Objective |
| :---: | :--- |
| **1** | 📂 **Collect & explore** historical sales data from retail sources |
| **2** | 🧹 **Clean & preprocess** data (handle missing values, outliers, duplicates) |
| **3** | 🏗 **Engineer features** for better model performance (time-based features, aggregates) |
| **4** | 📊 **Perform EDA** to identify sales trends, top products, and key customers |
| **5** | 🤖 **Train & compare** multiple regression models (Linear Regression, Random Forest, XGBoost) |
| **6** | 📈 **Evaluate** models using MAE, RMSE, and R² metrics |
| **7** | 💼 **Provide business insights** and recommendations based on model interpretation |

